ersonal  electronic device worn as a necklace  that can be used for communication and a  variety of other tasks to enter the  building with agito after they managed  to set out from the room agito shows her  the neutral city they live in and  invites her to live with him but she's  still confused about this strange  situation of the world she meets yonder  an enhanced woman like argitos and  kane's father acknowledging her as a  past world human she allows tula to live  in neutral city which made agito and his  friends happy yonder as the city  representative asked the forest to  release water but the forest refuses to  do so because of tulla the forest  angered by tulla's awakening since she's  carries a rabbun the forest fears that  she'll fall into the hands of shunok a  soldier of ragnar and also a person from  the past who's awakened from sleep and  that will use her rabban to locate  e-stock the environmental regrowth  defragmentation system a powerful weapon  with the ability to wipe out the forest  and restore human control over the world  schunak's the main villain of the film  and the best part about the film is that  the antagonist motives actually make  sense instead of making someone purely  evil schunk's character is multi-layered  the forest considers her the harbinger  of destruction for both mankind and the  forest ragna city announced a reward for  anyone who locates the person from the  past agito and kane got punished for  their adventure in the forest they got  tasked with extraction work in a ruined  building as a punishment on the other  hand minka was tasked with guiding tulla  around the city she took her to the main  market of the city where people from all  over the world gather to sell things in  exchange for water but because of the  water shortage water itself has become a  currency then she showed tulla her  working place which was a bar on their  way back home they filled buckets of  water for use tulla had a hard time  carrying a single bucket because of a  fragile physique while leaving minka  told her that she'll be the future wife  of agito she said so because aguito  seemed to be interested in tula  someone's trying to contact tulla by her  raban as it starts ringing suddenly then  agito notices her walking to the forest  and goes after her as it's dangerous  there he introduced his father to her  who was almost a tree with some  remaining human body agito's father told  her to accept this reality of humans if  she wants to live in this world argito  boasted about his father and other  people who built this city on their own  as a peaceful place for living shunak  eventually finds out about tula and  marches into neutral city with his army  to persuade her to join him the forest  sends a giant creature to stop the  meeting which schunak single-handedly  destroys revealing that he has been  enhanced he allowed himself to be  genetically altered by the forest in  order to become stronger by using the  power of the trees convinced that  finding e-stock is the only way to  restore the earth back to the world  which she once knew tula joined schunak  in his quest to spy aguito's plea not to  agito consults with his father the  founder of neutral city who as a result  of being enhanced and having overused  his powers has turned almost completely  into a tree with a few days left before  becoming a tree completely he encourages  aguito to save the forest from  shoenack's plan since destroying the  trees would mean the destruction of  mankind as well aguito journeys to the  forest minka decides to go with her as  she couldn't stop him minkah's father  stomps her telling her that it's agito's  decision and they should respect it  after entering the forest he submits  himself to the forest the forest grants  him powers and he awakens with a new  enhanced body with white silver hairs  agito rushes to ragnar where shunok took  tula by using his enhanced body he  reached the city within minutes and  destroyed the guarding machines with his  powerful fists shunak ordered his men to  attack him even the most powerful  weapons were useless against him the  army of ragnar uses sleeping gas on the  orders of shunok to capture him they  restrained him with big metal chains  upon regaining consciousness aguito sees  tulla he tries again to convince her but  she ignores his warnings she leaves  while telling him that it's for the best  of mankind schunak secretly orders his  men to kill agito he gathered all of his  strength and use the power of the forest  to break free from the chains he rushes  out and attacks the train with his  tree-like hand the army attacked him but  like always it was no use shunak moves  all the gunpowder to the back of the  train and releases that compartment of  the trade he then unleashes fire on the  leftover block causing it to blow off  now this particular sequence is quite  intense agito sustained some injuries  because of it and went mad with rage  yonder finds him and helps him regain  control of his body she told him to  control the enhanced powers by focusing  his consciousness on the seed implanted  within him by the forest after calming  down agito followed shunak and tula to  e-stock which turns out to be a huge  volcano converted into a mechanized  weapon  e-stock as it turns out was created by  tulla's father the doctor who'd begun  the genetic research on the trees as a  safeguard against the new species  schunk betrays the ragna army in  commandeers estoc revealing his true  intentions to use the weapon to clear  his guilt it so happens that schunak  worked on the original genetic  alteration experiments on the trees but  becoming impatient had tried to speed up  the alteration process leading to the  catastrophic invasion of the mutant  trees a holograph of dr sakul who's  tula's father appears after the  activation of estoc that explains  everything about the machine and the  destruction it can cause the doctor  ended the speech by giving the decision  of using e-stock to the people of  stayfield the ragnar army attacked the  moving mounted e-stock with all their  weapons the mountain activates weapons  for counter-attacking to the demise of  the ragnar army the weapons were more  advanced and powerful the flames of war  reached the neutral city but kane's  father destroys the incoming meteors  with its enhanced powers when tulla  learns that schunak intends to activate  e-stock on neutral city destroying it  completely in the process she has a  change of heart tries to stop shunak  from activating e-stock but is quickly  overwhelmed agito finds them and has a  showdown with schunak to save tulla he  lets his enhancement take over and he  transforms into a tree essentially  killing himself and shoenok in the  process tula deactivates estoc while  looking at the hologram of her father  and the weapon and the weapon begins to  self-destruct however tula refuses to  leave without aagito having developed  strong feelings for him although  aguito's body has been absorbed by the  tree his consciousness is intact on  another plane and there the forest  reveals to him the truth about the  relationship between itself and the  humans argito learns that the genetic  admixture that gives humans  extraordinary strength and eventually  turns them into trees is really a  two-way exchange it also changes the  forest causing trees to give birth to  new humans in giant fruits shunak having  become one with the forest finds peace  with himself and no longer intends to  fight agito the forest seeing the argito  can teach humanity that there's no need  for either hostility or separation  between themselves and the trees grants  him his human form back allowing him and  tula to escape before east stock erupts  into flames  having saved both the humans and the  forest agito brings peace between all  humans in the trees tulla finally lets  go of her past by throwing her rabbana  off a ledge down into the depths of the  forest and learning to live in harmony  with the trees at last so basically the  film actually has a deeper message  behind its plot it portrays the horrors  of climate change so that was it for  today's video we hope you enjoyed it  make sure to hit that like button and  don't forget to subscribe to our channel  for similar videos

